  "body": "Nestled in the heart of the prestigious Macleans College zone, this stunning 4-bedroom residence at 33B Sorrel Crescent offers the perfect blend of contemporary style and functional family living. Freehold, low-maintenance, and impeccably presented - this is the Bucklands Beach lifestyle you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a home designed for effortless connection. The expansive open-plan living and dining area is flooded with natural light, centered around a sleek, chef-ready kitchen that acts as the hub of the home. With high-quality finishes and warm timber-look flooring, the atmosphere is calm, modern, and inviting - perfect for everything from relaxed family evenings to weekend entertaining.\r\n\r\nFor families, the educational credentials here are world-class. You are perfectly positioned within the highly sought-after Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pigeon Mountain School zones. Beyond the front door, enjoy easy access to pristine local beaches, parks, and the vibrant cafes of East Auckland.\r\n\r\nKey Property Features:\r\n• Prime Education: Zoned for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate & Pigeon Mountain School.\r\n• Ownership: Freehold title (approx. 193m² land area).\r\n• Modern Design: 4 spacious bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and approx. 161m² of floor area.\r\n• Lifestyle: Open-plan living, dining, and kitchen built for entertaining.\r\n• Convenience: Low-maintenance living with single garage and walking distance to top schools.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking a modern home in Bucklands Beach, within the Macleans College Zone, with freehold ownership and effortless contemporary living, this is an opportunity not to be overlooked.\r\n\r\nYour next chapter begins here.",
